    68→ * @param cwd - Working directory to run the command in
    69→ * @param options - Optional settings for stdin, error handling, env vars
    70→ * @returns KspecResult with exitCode, stdout, stderr
    71→ * @throws Error if command fails and expectFail is not set
    72→ *
